<title>USA: Federal-Mogul to consolidate functions.</title>
<headline>Federal-Mogul to consolidate functions.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHFIELD, Mich. 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal-Mogul Corp said Wednesday it will consolidate its customer support functions in Southfield and in Phoenix into its world headquarters in Michigan.</p>
<p>The company, which makes and distributes parts for automobiles, trucks, and farm and construction vehicles, said 40 full-time and 20 part-time employees in Phoenix will be affected by the move. About 30 to 40 positions will be created in Michigan, Federal-Mogul said.</p>
<p>The company's shares closed unchanged Wednesday at 25.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
